msgstr "アクセシビリティーダッシュボードのテンプレート"

#: ../../source/portal-user-guide/accessibility/index.rst:207
msgid "To further enhance usability, we have created an **Accessibility Dashboard** that simplifies navigation for users with disabilities. This dashboard features a dedicated Shortcuts Widget that displays available shortcuts. When the dashboard opens, this widget is automatically focused and read aloud by the screen reader."
