#~ msgid "When a user jumps to the first case element using a shortcut, the screen reader reads the information in the following format: \"Case Name: `<case name>` - State: `<state>` - Created On: `<creation date>` - Finished On: `<finish date>` - Owners: `<first owner name>`.\" If the selected task or case is not in the \"Completed\" state, all relevant details are read aloud to inform the user of the current status."
